# HR Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

## 📊 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing Human Resources (HR) data to gain insights into employee attrition, workforce demographics, and employee-related trends.

The interactive Power BI dashboard helps identify patterns in employee turnover and supports data-driven HR decision-making.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

* Analyze employee attrition and turnover patterns.
* Explore workforce demographics and employee characteristics.
* Identify factors associated with employee departures.
* Present key HR metrics through interactive visualizations.
* Support better, data-driven HR decisions.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

* **Power BI** – Data visualization and dashboard development
* **Power Query** – Data cleaning and transformation
* **DAX** – Calculated measures and KPI development

## 📈 Key Insights

* Employee attrition analysis
* Workforce distribution by department
* Employee demographics and job-related characteristics
* Comparison of employees who stayed and those who left

## 💡 Skills Demonstrated

